{"text":"Because me being the history geek that I am, like I know the deep dark recesses of the founding fathers shortcomings that people don't even want to know and you know I was called forth to write this poem about hope and faith and unity in the United States, which I think for a lot of us feels like we're so distantly removed from. But I think for me it was returning back to what I was talking about, which is the power of words, and it is true, you know, I'm the descendant of slaves when this declaration of independence was being written I was not included in any way shape or form or comma. But the words that we say whether or not we're currently living up to them I think then create a testament to time. And so this is a poem that I wrote for that called believers him for the Republic. It's supposed to be to the music of battle him for the Republic, which is a very famous Civil War song so imagine that in your heads.","words":[{"text":"Because","start":0.0,"end":0.64},{"text":"me","start":0.64,"end":1.16},{"text":"being","start":1.16,"end":1.58},{"text":"the","start":1.58,"end":1.78},{"text":"history","start":1.78,"end":2.12},{"text":"geek","start":2.12,"end":2.34},{"text":"that","start":2.34,"end":2.48},{"text":"I","start":2.48,"end":2.62},{"text":"am","start":2.62,"end":2.96,"punct":","},{"text":"like","start":3.3,"end":3.3},{"text":"I","start":3.3,"end":3.54},{"text":"know","start":3.54,"end":3.96},{"text":"the","start":3.96,"end":5.04},{"text":"deep","start":5.04,"end":5.62},{"text":"dark","start":5.62,"end":6.14},{"text":"recesses","start":6.14,"end":6.94},{"text":"of","start":6.94,"end":7.1},{"text":"the","start":7.1,"end":7.26},{"text":"founding","start":7.26,"end":7.6},{"text":"fathers","start":7.6,"end":8.16},{"text":"shortcomings","start":8.16,"end":8.74},{"text":"that","start":8.74,"end":9.06},{"text":"people","start":9.06,"end":9.28},{"text":"don't","start":9.28,"end":9.52},{"text":"even","start":9.52,"end":9.76},{"text":"want","start":9.76,"end":9